---
title: "getAllMembers (stem-bot-v2: src/api/members.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_fetch_db: supabase.from("members").select().is("deleted_at", null)
    q_fetch_db --> q_500_db: error from supabase
    q_fetch_db --> q_check_empty: members fetched
    q_500_db --> [*]: res.status(500)
    q_check_empty --> q_respond_empty: !members or length === 0
    q_check_empty --> q_get_guild: members exist
    q_respond_empty --> [*]: res.json(data = [])
    q_get_guild --> q_500_config: DISCORD_GUILD_ID not set
    q_get_guild --> q_iter: guild fetched
    q_500_config --> [*]: res.status(500) "Server configuration error"
    q_iter --> q_fetch_discord: Promise.all(members.map(fetch discord member))
    q_fetch_discord --> q_extract_name: discordMember found
    q_fetch_discord --> q_skip: discordMember not found (returns null)
    q_extract_name --> q_parse_name: displayName = nickname or user.displayName
    q_parse_name --> q_collect: name = extract before parenthesis
    q_skip --> q_collect: null entry
    q_collect --> q_filter: filter null entries
    q_filter --> [*]: res.json(success, data = validMembers)

    note right of q_iter
        INV-001: Parallel Discord API calls via Promise.all
        INV-002: Returns uid, name, username for all active members
        INV-003: Soft-deleted members (deleted_at != null) excluded
    end note
